description:
Implement `useLatest` — a hook that returns a ref whose `.current` always holds the most recent value, without triggering re-renders when the value changes. Useful for accessing the current value inside callbacks or effects.

**Example:**
```tsx
const countRef = useLatest(count);
const handleClick = useCallback(() => {
  console.log(countRef.current); // always latest count
}, []); // empty deps — no stale closure
```

